BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Killarney] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260324T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260324T080000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1548@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Killarney will be unavailable Tuesday and Wednesday\, March 24
  and 25\, 2025\, starting at 07:00 EDT (11:00 UTC) on Tuesday. During this
  time\, you will not be able to log in or run jobs on the cluster. Any job
 s that are running at the time of the outage will be terminated and you wi
 ll need to re-submit them once the cluster is back online.\nDuring this ti
 me l ogin nodes and file systems will not be available.\n\nhttps://status.
 alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1548
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1548
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Killarney] Planned Outage - Arrêt planifié
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260520T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260520T160000
DTSTAMP:20260703T134918Z
UID:drac-incident-1619@status.alliancecan.ca
CATEGORIES:SCHEDULED
DESCRIPTION:Killarney will be unavailable Wednesday\, May 20\, 2026\, from
  15:00 to 16:00 ET. During this time\, you will not be able to log in or r
 un jobs on the cluster. Any jobs that are running at the time of the outag
 e will be terminated and you will need to re-submit them once the cluster 
 is back online. Pending/queued jobs will be scheduled once service has bee
 n restored.\n\nhttps://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1619
URL:https://status.alliancecan.ca/view_incident?incident=1619
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
